### What a line is, is a precedence decision
POST https://api.example.com/echo
Content-Type: text/plain

# a body line outranks a comment prefix, so this is body
HTTP/1.1 200 OK — and a body line outranks a status line, so is this
### only a separator ends a body from the inside

PURGE https://api.example.com/cache
X-Note: PURGE is not a method, so the target is PURGE and the rest is a trailer

GET https://api.example.com/widgets
Accept: application/json
this line has no colon, so it is plain, not a new request
